   <article class="tale-step" data-tale-step="0"><span class="eyebrow">THE EVERYDAY QUESTION</span><h3>Kya banayein?</h3><p>A hungry Nitz. A curious Mini. And a kitchen full of possibilities. Sound familiar?</p><p class="handwritten">आज कुछ अच्छा बनाते हैं।</p></article>
   <article class="tale-step" data-tale-step="1"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE KITCHEN COMPANY</span><h3>A pinch.<br>A possibility.</h3><p>Mini has an idea. Start with something you love, add a little Minitz, and make the rest your own.</p><p class="handwritten">The recipe is only the beginning.</p></article>
